#### **T2: EF Core 10 + Npgsql + PostgreSQL**
- Implemented [`AppDbContext`](file:///home/kry/Projects/devpilot/rame-studio/src/Infrastructure/Persistence/AppDbContext.cs) with DbSets for all entities and Identity stores.
- Configured individual [`EntityTypeConfiguration`](file:///home/kry/Projects/devpilot/rame-studio/src/Infrastructure/Persistence/Configurations) classes with precision, JSON converters, relationships, and cascades.
- Implemented [`AppDbContextFactory`](file:///home/kry/Projects/devpilot/rame-studio/src/Infrastructure/Persistence/AppDbContextFactory.cs) supporting both `Host=...` and `postgres://` connection URIs.
- Generated migration [`InitialCreate`](file:///home/kry/Projects/devpilot/rame-studio/src/Infrastructure/Persistence/Migrations/20261024062749_InitialCreate.cs).

---

#### **T4: ASP.NET Core Identity + JWT Bearer Auth**
- Added [`IdentityConfig.cs`](file:///home/kry/Projects/devpilot/rame-studio/src/Infrastructure/Identity/IdentityConfig.cs) registering ASP.NET Core Identity with EF Core stores.
- Implemented [`JwtTokenService.cs`](file:///home/kry/Projects/devpilot/rame-studio/src/Infrastructure/Services/JwtTokenService.cs) issuing 60-minute JWTs with user id, email, role, and jti claims, plus DB-persisted refresh token rotation.
- Implemented [`AuthController.cs`](file:///home/kry/Projects/devpilot/rame-studio/src/Api/Controllers/AuthController.cs):
  - `POST /api/auth/register` (defaults to `CUSTOMER` role)
  - `POST /api/auth/login`
  - `POST /api/auth/refresh`
  - `GET /api/auth/me`
- Configured [`Program.cs`](file:///home/kry/Projects/devpilot/rame-studio/src/Api/Program.cs) with JWT Bearer validation, CORS policies, and controller endpoints.

---

#### **T5: Role-Based Authorization Policies**
- Registered authorization policies in [`Program.cs`](file:///home/kry/Projects/devpilot/rame-studio/src/Api/Program.cs):
  - `AdminOnly`: `ADMIN`
  - `TeamMemberOnly`: `TEAM_MEMBER`
  - `CustomerOnly`: `CUSTOMER`
  - `AdminOrTeam`: `ADMIN`, `TEAM_MEMBER`
- Created [`TestAuthController.cs`](file:///home/kry/Projects/devpilot/rame-studio/src/Api/Controllers/TestAuthController.cs) protecting endpoints with role-based policies.

