#### **T6: Seed Script**
- Implemented [`SeedData.cs`](file:///home/kry/Projects/devpilot/rame-studio/src/Infrastructure/Persistence/SeedData.cs):
  - Prepares roles `ADMIN`, `TEAM_MEMBER`, `CUSTOMER`.
  - Creates default test credentials:
    - `admin@rame.test` (`Admin123!`, `ADMIN`)
    - `team@rame.test` (`Team123!`, `TEAM_MEMBER`)
    - `customer@rame.test` (`Customer123!`, `CUSTOMER`)
  - Populates starter demo data: packages (Starter, Growth, Pro), projects, deliverables, tasks, calendar events, daily reports, leads, blog posts, and portfolio items.

